Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are dark time there is no denying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our world has prehaps faced no greater threat than it does today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I say this to our citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We，ever your servants …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,will continue to defend you liberty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,and repel the forces that seek to take it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your ministry remains strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，tea is ready，Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming，Mom！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Dudley hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still don't understand why we have to leave？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because it's not safe around here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，tell your father suppers nearly ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's so strong here。- Mm，she's wonderful isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obliviate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus，I was beginning to worry you had lost your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，we have saved you a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you bring news，I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It will happen Saturday，next。At night fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've heard differently my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dawlish，the auror has let slip that the Potter boy，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,will not be moved until the 30th of this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The day before he turns 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a false trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The auror office no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,plays any part in the protection of Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those closest to him believe we have infiltrated the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they got that right，didn't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What say you，Pius？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hears many things，my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whether the truth is among them，is not clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spoken like a true politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will I think prove most useful，Pius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where will he be taken，the boy？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,To a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most likely the home of someone in the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm told its been given every manner of protection possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once there it will be impractical to attack him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,My lord，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to volunteer myself for this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to kill the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wormtail！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have I not spoken to you about keeping our guest quiet？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right away，my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,As inspiring as I find your bloodlust，Bellatrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must be the one to kill Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I face an unfortunate complication.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That my wand and Potters share the same core.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are，in some ways，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can wound but not fatally harm one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I am to kill him，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must do it with another's wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，surely one of you would like the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you，Lucius？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My lord？- 「My Lord」？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I require your wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do I detect elm？- Yes，my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the core？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dragon heartstring，my lord。- Dragon heartstring？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,To those of you who do not know，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,we are joined tonight by
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Charity Burbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who until recently taught
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,at Hogwarts School of witchcraft and wizardry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her specialty was muggle studies
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is Miss Burbage's belief
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Muggles are not so different from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,She would，given her way，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,have us mate with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,To her the mixture of magical and Muggle blood
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,is not an abomination，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,but something，to be encouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nagini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello！- You're looking fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he's absolutely gorgeous…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say lets get undercover，before someone murders him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kingsley，I thought you were looking after the Prime Minister？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello Harry。Bill Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He wasn't always so handsome - Daredevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Caught one in Wales，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,name of Greyback
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I'll favor him one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh you're still beautiful to me，William.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must remember，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fleur Bill takes his steak on the raw side now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,My husband the joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，wait till you hear the news，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reamus and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right then，time for a cozy catch up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to get the hell out of here。And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter，you're underage，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,which means you've still got the trace on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the trace？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you sneezed，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Ministry will know who wipes your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The point is we have to use
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,those means of transport the trace can't detect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brooms，thestrals and the bike。We'll go in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,That way if anyone is out there waiting for us，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I reckon there will be，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,they won't know which Harry Potter is the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,The real one？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe you're familiar with this particular brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，absolutely not。- I told you he'd take it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，if you think I'm gonna let，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,everyone risk their lives for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've done if before，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taking that，becoming me。No！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well none of us really fancy it，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，imagine if something went wrong，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we be stuck as a screwy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,specky gits，forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone here is of age，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've all agreed to take the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Technically，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd been coerced
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mundungus Fletcher，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always been a huge admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nip it，Mundungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright Granger，its discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey，Hermione！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Straight in here，if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,For those of you who haven't taken polyjuice potion before，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tastes like goblin piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have enough experiences with that，do you，Mad-eye？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just trying to defuse the tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！We're identical！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Haven't you got anything a bit more sporting，have you？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I don't really fancy this color.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well fancy this，you're not you，so shove it，and strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to change too，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bill，look away，I'm hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.09,0:14:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew she was lying about that tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，your eyesight really is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right then，we'll be pairing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Each Potter will have a protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mundungus，stick tight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to keep an eye on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- As for Harry… - Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The real Harry。Where the devil are you anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here。- You ride with Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I brought you here 16 years ago，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,when you were no bigger than a bow truckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seems only right that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should be the one that take you away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，this is all very touching。Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head for the Burrows。We rendezvous there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On the count of three！- Hold tight，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your right！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid，we have to help the others！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't do that，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mad-Eye's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:16:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.95,0:17:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are the others？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is no one else back？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were on us right from the start，Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，thank goodness you two are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Death Eaters were waiting for us。It was an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron and Bill should have already been back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad and Fred as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick，into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh My boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:20:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come here！- What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What creature sat in the corner the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,first time Harry Potter visited my office in Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you mad？- What creature？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Grindylow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have been betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort knew you were being moved tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to make sure，you weren't an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last words Albus Dumbledore，spoke to the pair of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.63,0:20:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Harry is the best hope we have。」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Trust him。」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What gave you away？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hedwig，I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was trying to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,He deserves that。Brilliant he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be standing here without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is it so a surprise？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,We the last back？Where's George？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you feeling，Georgie？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Saint like。- Come again？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Saint like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm holey。I'm holey，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fred！Get it？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,A whole wide world of ear related humor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you go for 「I'm holey」.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think I'm still better looking than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mad-Eye's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mundungus took one look at Voldemort and disapparated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head for the burrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven，Seven…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Horcruxes… - They could be hidden anywhere，couldn't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.22,0:23:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,To tear the soul into seven pieces…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we destroy the Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,One destroys，Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do not lie to me。Do not lie to me。- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Going somewhere？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.06,0:24:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody else is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.55,0:24:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,For you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.41,0:24:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think Mad-Eye died for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:24:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think George took that curse for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.47,0:24:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You maybe the chosen one，mate…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,but this is a whole lot bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its always been bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come with me。- And leave Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.25,0:24:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mad？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,We wouldn't last two days，without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell her I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，you still got the trace on you，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,you still got the wedding…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.54,0:24:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care about a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.81,0:24:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，no matter whose it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.75,0:24:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to start finding these Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're our only chance，to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.93,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the longer we stay here，the stronger he gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight is not the night，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.74,0:25:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll only be doing him a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.85,0:25:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think he knows？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.55,0:25:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean they are bits of his soul，these Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.67,0:25:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pieces of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.32,0:25:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,When Dumbledore destroyed the Ring，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,you destroyed Tom Riddle's Diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must have felt something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.33,0:25:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,To kill the other Horcruxes，we have to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.38,0:25:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are they？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do we start？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.47,0:26:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zip me up，will you？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.85,0:26:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It seems silly doesn't it，a wedding？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.30,0:26:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Given what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.07,0:27:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe that's the best reason to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because of everything that's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All together now！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.38,0:27:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,One！Two！Three！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,How it looking your end，boys？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody，hell。What's the Minister of Magic doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.81,0:28:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,To what do we owe the pleasure，Minister？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we both know the answer to that question，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Herein it is set forth，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,the last will and testament of，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albus Percival Wulfric Brian Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.87,0:28:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「First，to Ronald Billius Weasley，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.39,0:28:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I leave my deluminlator。「
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.78,0:28:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「A device，of my own making，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the hope，that when things seem most dark…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.23,0:29:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,It will show him the light。「
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dumbledore left this for me？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？- Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.62,0:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「To Hermione Jean Granger，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.66,0:29:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I leave my copy of 'The Tales of Beedle the Bard'.「
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「In the hope that she find it entertaining and instructive 」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mom used to read me those.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The wizard and the hopping pot，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Babbity Rabbity and the Cackling Stump.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Babbity Rabbity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.83,0:30:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.06,0:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「To Harry James Potter
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.32,0:30:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I leave the snitch he caught
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.87,0:30:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「in his first
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quidditch match at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a reminder of the rewards of perseverance…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.47,0:30:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and skill.「
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.65,0:30:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that it then？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.15,0:30:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.91,0:30:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore left you，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.33,0:30:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,a second bequest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.61,0:30:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sword of Godric Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.27,0:30:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unfortunately，the sword of Gryffindor
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.67,0:30:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,was not Dumbledore's to give away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:31:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,As an important historical artifact it belongs…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.14,0:31:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,to Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.06,0:31:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It belongs to Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It came to him when he most needed it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.46,0:31:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sword may present itself
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.19,0:31:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,to any worthy Gryffindor，Miss Granger，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,that does not make it that wizards property.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in any event，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,the current whereabouts of the sword are unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.53,0:31:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Sword is Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.69,0:31:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what you are up，to，Mr。Potter，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.37,0:31:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you can't fight this war on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.41,0:31:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.05,0:32:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.27,0:32:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've interrupted your deep thoughts，haven't I？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.51,0:32:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see it growing small in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course not。How are you，Luna？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.98,0:32:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.78,0:32:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been bitten by garden a gnome and numbed my thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.06,0:32:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gnome saliva is very beneficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.44,0:32:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Xenophilius Lovegood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,We live just over the heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I trust you know Mr。Potter that we at the Quibbler，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.72,0:32:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,disagree with the Daily Prophet，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.94,0:32:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,and have always fully supported Dumbledore…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.11,0:33:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,during his lifetime and in his death，support you just as fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.54,0:33:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come Daddy。Harry doesn't want to talk to us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.17,0:33:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just too polite to say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.31,0:33:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- May I sit down？- Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.69,0:33:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,By all means，here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.02,0:33:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found what you wrote in the Daily Prophet，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.49,0:33:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,really moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.50,0:33:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You obviously knew Dumbledore well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.22,0:33:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I certainly knew him the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.16,0:33:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless we don't count his brother Aberforth，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.34,0:33:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,and somehow people never do seem to count，Aberforth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't even know he had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.49,0:33:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore was always very private，even as a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.91,0:33:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not despair，Elphias.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.15,0:33:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm told he's been thoroughly unrevealed by Rita Skeeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,In 800 pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:33:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Word has it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.74,0:34:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,that someone talked to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.80,0:34:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone who knew the Dumbledore family well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Both you and I know who that is，Elphias.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.43,0:34:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,A monstrous betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.79,0:34:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are，who are we talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.28,0:34:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bathilda Bagshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.66,0:34:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,My god，boy。She is only the most…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.45,0:34:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,celebrated magical historian of the last century.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.70,0:34:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was as close to the Dumbledore's as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.26,0:34:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I'm sure Rita Skeeter
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.96,0:34:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,thought it well worth a trip to Godric's Hollow，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.30,0:34:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,to take a peek into that old bird's records cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Godric's Hollow？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.18,0:34:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bathilda Bagshot lives in Godric's Hallow？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.37,0:34:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's where she first met，Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.65,0:34:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't mean to say he lived there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.20,0:34:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The family moved there
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.88,0:34:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,after his father killed those three Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.72,0:34:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was quite the scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:34:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly my boy，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.34,0:35:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,are you sure you knew him at all？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.44,0:35:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ministry has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.15,0:35:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Minister of Magic，is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.18,0:35:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.62,0:35:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.35,0:35:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.23,0:36:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.62,0:36:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shaftesbury Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.15,0:36:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I used to come up here to theaters with mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.98,0:36:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why I thought of it。It just popped into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.18,0:36:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.81,0:36:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.81,0:36:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody Hell
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.81,0:36:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Undetectable Extension charm。- You're amazing，you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.61,0:36:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always a total surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:36:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，that'll be the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.98,0:37:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about all the people at the wedding？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.15,0:37:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think that we should go back？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.05,0:37:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're after you，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.39,0:37:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd put everyone in danger by going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron's right。- Coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A cappuccino please - You？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.72,0:37:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What she said。- Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.98,0:37:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,So where do we go from here？Leaky Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.60,0:37:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.56,0:37:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Voldemort has taken over the Ministry，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.31,0:37:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,none of the old places are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.79,0:37:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone from the wedding would have gone underground，into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.06,0:37:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,My rucksack with all my things。I've left it at the burrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.14,0:37:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.91,0:37:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had the essentials，packed for days。Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.14,0:38:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，why're the jeans not my favourite？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.28,0:38:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupify！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.60,0:38:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Petrificus Totalus！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.45,0:38:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.67,0:38:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock the door，get the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one's names Rawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.67,0:38:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was on the astronomy tower the last night they killed Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.27,0:38:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Dolohov.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.21,0:38:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I recognize him from the wanted notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:38:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what we're gonna do with you，eh？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill us if it was turned round，wouldn't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We kill them，they'll know we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.46,0:39:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron。- Suppose he did Mad-eye？How would you feel then？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's better we wipe their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the boss。Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.13,0:39:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the best with spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.30,0:39:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obliviate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.00,0:39:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is it they knew we were there？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.61,0:39:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you still have the trace on you？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can't，the trace stays until I'm seventeen year's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.62,0:40:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.09,0:40:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't celebrate your birthday，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.38,0:40:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny and I，we prepared a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.23,0:40:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were going to bring it out at the end of the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.27,0:40:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，honestly，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.95,0:40:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I appreciate the thought，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.29,0:40:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,but really given the fact，that we were almost killed
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.17,0:40:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,by a couple of Death Eaters a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.71,0:40:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right… perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.35,0:40:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to get off the streets，get to someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that all about？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.37,0:41:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably Mad-Eye's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.96,0:41:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,In case Snape decides to come snooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.28,0:41:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Homenum Revelio.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.96,0:41:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.14,0:41:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another wand！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe a different wand would work？I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.77,0:41:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,It should be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.42,0:43:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.70,0:43:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it dark up there？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.67,0:43:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Regulus Arcturus Black
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.29,0:43:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.59,0:43:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I know I will be dead long before you read this。」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.09,0:43:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I have stolen the real horcrux and intend to destroy it。」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.52,0:43:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B，he was Sirius' brother？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.17,0:43:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The question is he didn't actually destroy the real Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spying on us，have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.97,0:44:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kreacher，has been watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.77,0:44:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe he knows where the real locket is？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.71,0:44:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen this before？Kreacher？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.66,0:44:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It is Master Regulus's locket！- There were two，weren't there？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's the other one？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.72,0:44:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kreacher doesn't know，about the other locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.90,0:44:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but did you ever see it？It was in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.91,0:44:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Filthy mudblood that's what you are，Blood traitor Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.22,0:44:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Answer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.90,0:44:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.18,0:44:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was here，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.35,0:45:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.86,0:45:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most evil object.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.37,0:45:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.88,0:45:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before Master Regulus died，he ordered Kreacher to destroy，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.51,0:45:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,but no matter how hard Kreacher tried，he could not do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.55,0:45:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，where is it now？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did someone take it？- He came in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.26,0:45:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He took many things including the locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.38,0:45:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who did？Who was it，Kreacher？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.49,0:45:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mundungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.38,0:45:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mundungus Fletcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.99,0:45:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.08,0:46:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,My father will hear about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.87,0:46:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey losers。He isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.35,0:46:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,As your new Minister for Magic，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.87,0:46:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promise to restore this temple of tolerance
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.51,0:46:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.20,0:46:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Therefore beginning today，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.20,0:46:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,each employee will submit themselves，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.31,0:46:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,for evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.61,0:46:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,But know this，you have nothing to fear，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.16,0:46:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you have nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.34,0:47:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have flesh memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.74,0:48:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,When Scrimgeour first gave it to you，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.17,0:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought，it might open at to your touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.93,0:48:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,That Dumbledore hidden something inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.14,0:48:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter，how long it's been！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.58,0:48:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off me！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.48,0:48:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.46,0:48:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you playing at？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.85,0:48:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Setting a pair of bleeding house elves after me？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.93,0:48:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby was only trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.94,0:48:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,When Dobby saw Kreacher in Diagon Alley，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.51,0:48:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which Dobby thought was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.53,0:48:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then Dobby heard Kreacher mention Harry Potter's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.02,0:48:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then Dobby saw Kreacher talking with the thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.24,0:48:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a thief？You foul little…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.82,0:48:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,git.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.37,0:49:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a purveyor of rare and wondrous objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.64,0:49:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a thief，Dung，everyone knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.49,0:49:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Master Weasley，so good to see you。- Like your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.76,0:49:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I panicked that night，alright？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.34,0:49:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't help it if Mad-Eye fell off his broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.51,0:49:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You。- Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.76,0:49:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you turned this place over，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.35,0:49:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,don't deny it，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.29,0:49:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,you found a locket，am I right？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.49,0:49:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why，was it valuable？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.03,0:49:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，was it？- He's worried he didn't get enough money for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.91,0:49:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleeding give it away，didn't I？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.41,0:49:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,There I was plogging my wares in Diagon alley，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.25,0:49:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,when some Ministry hag comes up and asks to see me license.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.20,0:49:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says she the one would lock me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.79,0:49:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would have done too，if she hadn't taken a fancy to that locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.37,0:49:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who was it？The witch，do you know her？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.71,0:49:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know her？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:50:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's there。Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.62,0:50:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleedin' bone who.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，remember what we said.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't speak to anyone，unless absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.87,0:50:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just，try and act normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.21,0:50:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do what everybody else is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we do that and with a bit of luck we'll get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.81,0:51:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And then… - It gets really tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.23,0:51:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.42,0:51:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is completely mental。- Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.46,0:51:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,The world's mental。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.69,0:51:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a Horcrux to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.01,0:52:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,We flush ourselves in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.34,0:52:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its bloody disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.22,0:52:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You，come along。- What，what？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.66,0:52:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did I do？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.96,0:53:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are those… - Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.26,0:53:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,In their… rightful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.50,0:53:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got to tell you，I'm starting to freak out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.21,0:53:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long did you say this batch of polyjuice will last，Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.02,0:53:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.25,0:53:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cattermole.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.20,0:53:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its still raining inside my office。Its two days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.83,0:53:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you tried an umbrella？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.61,0:53:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you realize I'm going downstairs don't you，Cattermole？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.09,0:53:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Downstairs？- To interrogate your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.94,0:53:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now if my wife's blood status were in doubt，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.21,0:53:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the Head of Department
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.63,0:54:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,of Magical Law Enforcement needed a job doing，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.07,0:54:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I might just make that a priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.21,0:54:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.95,0:54:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my god，what am I gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.79,0:54:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,My wife's all alone downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.97,0:54:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，you don't have a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.72,0:54:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.72,0:54:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Level Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.29,0:54:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how do I stop it raining？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.63,0:54:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try 「Finite Incantatem」.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.87,0:54:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is you，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.16,0:54:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finite Incantatem，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.33,0:54:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if that doesn't work？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.37,0:55:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say if we don't locate Umbridge within the hour，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.47,0:55:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,we go find Ron and come back another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.56,0:55:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Deal？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.75,0:55:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，Mafalda。Trevor sent you，did he？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.67,0:55:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。We'll go straight down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.08,0:55:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albert，weren't you getting out？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.09,0:56:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Runcorn？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.54,0:56:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Accio locket！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.43,0:57:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right。Let's calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.62,0:57:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lets get back to work，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.06,0:57:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.13,0:58:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Runcorn？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.48,0:58:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.07,0:58:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron，it's me。- Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.73,0:58:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey！Forgot what you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.75,0:58:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.73,0:58:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's gone down to the court rooms，with Umbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.55,0:58:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody cold down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.78,0:58:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm half blood。My father，my father was a wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.82,0:58:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,William Waldenten，he worked here for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.31,0:58:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you know him。He Always wore a jacket inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.46,0:58:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,There must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.37,0:58:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell the ministry，I must go to work，I'm half blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.72,0:59:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mary Elizabeth Cattermole，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.19,0:59:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,of 27 Chislehurst Gardens，Great Tolling，Itchum.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.99,0:59:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.28,0:59:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother to Maisie，Ellie and Alfred; Wife to Reginald？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.45,0:59:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Regi.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.83,0:59:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Albert.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.38,0:59:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mary Elizabeth Cattermole.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.22,0:59:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.40,0:59:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,A wand was taken from you upon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.80,0:59:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,your arrival at the Ministry today，Mrs。Cattermole
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.25,0:59:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this that wand？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.76,0:59:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you please tell the court，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.58,0:59:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,from which witch or wizard you took this wand？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.63,1:00:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.11,1:00:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bought it at Diagon Alley，at Ollivanders，when I was 11.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.23,1:00:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,It chose me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.24,1:00:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.76,1:00:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wands only choose witches，and you are not a witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.33,1:00:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.80,1:00:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them，Reg，tell them what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.68,1:00:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reg，tell them who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.67,1:00:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What on earth are you doing，Albert？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.30,1:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lying，Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.69,1:00:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,And one mustn't tell lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.73,1:01:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's Harry Potter！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.36,1:01:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's him isn't it。This is one to tell the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.11,1:01:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto patronum！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.46,1:01:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mary，go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.02,1:01:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.96,1:01:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.77,1:01:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to get out of the country，understand？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.37,1:01:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mary，do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.06,1:02:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mary？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.90,1:02:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.92,1:02:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Long story，nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.25,1:02:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry Potter。- It's Harry，Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.25,1:03:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.14,1:04:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，Harry，quickly，in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a bottle labeled 「Essence of Dittany」.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.77,1:04:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quickly！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.29,1:04:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Accio Dittany！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.44,1:04:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，unstopper it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.42,1:04:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，his arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.81,1:04:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，just do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.73,1:04:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna… It's gonna sting a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.37,1:04:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.33,1:04:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought we were going to go back to Grimmauld Place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.14,1:04:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were。Alright，One more，one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.81,1:04:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were there we were there but，Yaxley had a hold of me，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew once he'd seen where we were we，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.67,1:04:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,we couldn't stay so，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.36,1:04:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I brought us here，but，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.28,1:04:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron got splinched.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.95,1:05:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protego Totalum.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.70,1:05:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Salvio Hexia。- What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.95,1:05:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protective enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.41,1:05:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't fancy another visit
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,like the one we had at Shaftesbury Avenue，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.11,1:05:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can get going on a tent.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.50,1:05:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tent？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.49,1:05:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Protego Totalum。- Where am I supposed to find a tent？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.32,1:05:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Repello Muggletum。Muffliato.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.47,1:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You first.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.88,1:06:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incendio.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.36,1:06:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expulso！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.66,1:06:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diffindo！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.13,1:06:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reducto！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.50,1:06:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.97,1:07:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to keep it safe，until we find out how to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.91,1:07:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seems strange，mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.06,1:07:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore sent you off to find these Horcruxes，
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.13,1:07:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,but doesn't tell you how to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.91,1:07:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't that bother you？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.04,1:07:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the spell，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.24,1:07:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell me，Gregorovitch。- He stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.10,1:08:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who was he，the thief？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.50,1:08:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boy。It was he who took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.80,1:08:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never saw it again，I swear on my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.00,1:08:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.01,1:08:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.48,1:08:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought it stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.11,1:08:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't keep letting him in，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.60,1:08:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You-Know-Who has found，Gregorovitch。- The Wand Maker？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.72,1:08:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants something that Gregorovitch used to have.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.18,1:09:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what。But he wants it desperately.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.12,1:09:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，it's as if his life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.30,1:09:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't，it comforts him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.04,1:09:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It sets my teeth on edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.48,1:09:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he expecting to hear，good news？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.29,1:09:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he just hopes that he doesn't hear bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.73,1:09:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long before he can travel？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.05,1:09:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I… I'm doing everything I can。- You're not doing enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.31,1:09:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take it off！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.01,1:09:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，Take it off，now！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.59,1:09:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Better？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.81,1:09:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll take it in turns，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.51,1:10:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus Snape voted in as headmaster of Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.63,1:11:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.20,1:11:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that，smell？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.41,1:12:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatcha doing？It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.69,1:12:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh I'm sorry。Do you want me to carry it？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.16,1:12:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snatchers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.85,1:12:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good to know your enchantments work.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could smell it，my perfume.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.66,1:12:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.00,1:12:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron isn't strong enough to apparate.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.92,1:12:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well then，we'll go on foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.64,1:12:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only next time，as much as you like your perfume，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.08,1:12:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,just don't wear any.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.24,1:13:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now for the names of missing witches and wizards.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.07,1:13:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are confirmed，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.69,1:13:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,thankfully the list is short today.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.28,1:13:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason and Alison Denbright.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.35,1:13:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.04,1:13:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bella，Jake，Charlie，and Madge Farley.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.13,1:13:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joe Laurie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.37,1:13:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eleanor Sarah Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.27,1:13:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry and Bronwyn Trigg.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.33,1:13:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rob and Ellie Dowson.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.30,1:13:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Georgia Clark-Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.61,1:13:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joshua Flexson.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.59,1:13:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,George Coutas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.00,1:13:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gabriella and Emily Mather.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.89,1:13:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jacob and Mimi Erland.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.90,1:13:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,William and Brian Gallagher.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.61,1:14:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He doesn't know what he's doing，does he？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.53,1:14:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of us do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.54,1:14:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Katie and James Killick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.58,1:14:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Elsie Valentine Schroeder.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.07,1:14:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer Winston.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.18,1:14:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tamsin and Iola Hillicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.55,1:14:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh My God！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.07,1:14:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.65,1:14:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you can tell me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.64,1:14:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sword of Gryffindor。It's goblin made.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.91,1:14:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.99,1:15:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.61,1:15:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dirt and rust have no effect on the blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.15,1:15:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It only takes in that which makes it stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.90,1:15:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,O… kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.54,1:15:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，we've already destroyed one horcrux，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.07,1:15:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Riddle's diary in the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.72,1:15:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,With a basilisk fang.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.36,1:15:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you tell me you've got one of those
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.47,1:15:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,in that bloody beaded bag of yours…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.25,1:15:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you see？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.59,1:15:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,In The Chamber of Secrets，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.44,1:15:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,you stabbed the Basilisk with the sword of Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.32,1:15:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its blade is impregnated with basilisk venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.91,1:15:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It only takes in that which makes it stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.14,1:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Exactly，which is why… - It can destroy Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.83,1:15:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why Dumbledore left it to you in his will.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.91,1:15:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're brilliant，Hermione。Truly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.42,1:15:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I'm highly logical
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.01,1:15:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,which allows me to slip past extraneous details.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.74,1:15:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And perceive clearly that which others overlook.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.81,1:15:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，there is only one problem with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.54,1:16:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sword was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.03,1:16:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.32,1:16:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you two carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.70,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let me spoil the fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.66,1:16:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's wrong？- Wrong？Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.56,1:16:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,According to you，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.49,1:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you got something to say，don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.52,1:16:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.72,1:16:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，I'll spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.07,1:16:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But don't expect me to be grateful
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.49,1:16:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,just because now it's another damn thing we got to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.84,1:16:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you knew what you signed up for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.60,1:16:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I thought it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.41,1:16:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。But I don't quite understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.88,1:16:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What part of this isn't living up to your expectations？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.51,1:16:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you think we were going to be staying in a five star hotel？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.72,1:16:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finding a Horcrux every other day.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.52,1:16:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You thought you'd be back with your mum by Christmas？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.60,1:16:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just thought，after all this time
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.07,1:16:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,we would actually have achieved something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.38,1:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you knew what you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.69,1:16:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought Dumbledore would have told you something worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.95,1:16:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you had a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.70,1:16:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you everything Dumbledore told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.32,1:16:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in case you haven't notice we have found a Horcrux already.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.95,1:17:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we're as close to getting rid of it
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.72,1:17:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,as we are to finding the rest of them，aren't we？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.83,1:17:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，Please，take off the Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.71,1:17:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be saying any of this
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.61,1:17:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you hadn't been wearing it all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.20,1:17:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know，why I listen to the radio every night，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.91,1:17:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,To make sure I don't hear Ginny's name，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.90,1:17:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,or Fred，or George or Moms.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.97,1:17:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I'm not listening too？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.81,1:17:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I don't know how it feels？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.43,1:17:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No you don't know how it feels！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.84,1:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your parents are dead！You have no family！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.60,1:17:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.82,1:17:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let me go！- Go then！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.47,1:17:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.32,1:17:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.78,1:17:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you coming or are you staying？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.37,1:18:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine，I get it。I saw you two the other night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.56,1:18:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron there's… there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.06,1:18:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.77,1:18:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.49,1:18:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.66,1:18:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.82,1:18:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.07,1:19:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Salvia Hexia.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.77,1:22:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I open at the close.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.44,1:22:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione。Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.10,1:22:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were right。Snitches have flesh memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.22,1:23:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I didn't catch the first snitch with my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.30,1:23:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I almost swallowed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.28,1:23:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「I open at the close。」 - Yeah，what do you think that means？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.96,1:23:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found something as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.73,1:23:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,At first I thought it was an eye，but now I don't think it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.31,1:23:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It isn't a rune，and it isn't anywhere in Spellman's syllabary.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.96,1:23:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody inked it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.52,1:23:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It isn't part of the book，somebody drew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.42,1:23:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luna's dad was wearing it at Bill and Fleur's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.58,1:23:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would someone draw it in a children's book？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.53,1:23:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.49,1:23:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to go to Godric's Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.78,1:23:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's where I was born，It's where my parents died.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.11,1:23:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's exactly where he'll expect you to go
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.23,1:24:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,because it means something to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.53,1:24:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it means something to him too，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.47,1:24:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You-Know-Who almost died there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.58,1:24:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that exactly the type of place
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.53,1:24:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,he'd be likely to hide a Horcrux？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I… it's dangerous，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.49,1:24:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,But even I have to admit
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.73,1:24:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,recently I've been thinking we have to go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.71,1:24:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's possible something else is hidden there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.74,1:24:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Dumbledore wanted you to find it，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.72,1:24:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and didn't want it to falling in to the Ministry hands，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.70,1:24:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,where better to hide it than
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.07,1:24:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,the birthplace of the founder of Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.24,1:24:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.26,1:24:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ever let me give you a haircut again.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.44,1:25:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still think that we should use the Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.16,1:25:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，this is where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.94,1:25:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not returning as someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.27,1:25:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I think it's Christmas eve.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.35,1:25:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.52,1:25:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think they may be in there，Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.90,1:25:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.61,1:25:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I think they would.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.47,1:26:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ignotus Peverell.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.17,1:26:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.18,1:27:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.56,1:27:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.74,1:27:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，there is someone watching us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.56,1:27:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the church.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.40,1:28:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.70,1:28:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't like this，Harry。- Hermione，she knew Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.49,1:28:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,She might have the sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.13,1:28:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is where they died，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.22,1:28:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is where he murdered them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.20,1:28:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Bathilda，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.90,1:29:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，let me do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.02,1:29:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Bagshot，who is this man？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.40,1:29:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.62,1:31:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.10,1:33:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.22,1:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've outdone yourself this time，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.04,1:33:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forest of Dean.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.18,1:33:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came here once with Mum and Dad。Years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.17,1:33:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just how I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.51,1:33:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The trees，the river，everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.81,1:33:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like nothings changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.01,1:33:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not true of course，everything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.58,1:33:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I brought my parents back here now，
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.38,1:33:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,they probably wouldn't recognize any of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.90,1:33:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.09,1:33:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.66,1:33:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not even me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.00,1:33:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just stay here，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.82,1:34:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grow old.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.96,1:34:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanted to know who was the boy in the photograph was.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.96,1:34:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.20,1:34:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gellert Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.70,1:34:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the thief I saw in Gregorovitch's wand shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.74,1:34:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speaking of which，where is my wand？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.73,1:34:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's my wand，Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.87,1:34:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,As we were leaving Godrics Hollow
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.42,1:34:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cast a curse and it rebounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.92,1:34:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.84,1:34:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tried to mend it，but wands are different.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.49,1:34:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.42,1:34:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave me yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.42,1:35:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go inside and get warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.84,1:35:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take the locket as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.93,1:36:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.64,1:37:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Accio sword！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.69,1:37:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diffindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.99,1:39:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.39,1:39:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mental？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.45,1:39:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.35,1:39:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well yeah，bit obvious，I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.66,1:39:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you cast the doe as well did you？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.44,1:39:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I thought that was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.79,1:39:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，my Patronus was a stag.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.30,1:39:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，now that was…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.84,1:39:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Ron。Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.91,1:39:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.74,1:39:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That thing affect me more than it effects you and Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.01,1:39:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All the more reason。- No，I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.07,1:39:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then why are you here？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.47,1:39:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did you come back？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.24,1:40:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I'll have to speak to it in order for it to open.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.48,1:40:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,When it does，don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.07,1:40:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what's in there，but it will put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.26,1:40:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bit of Riddle that was in that diary tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.28,1:40:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.48,1:40:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.34,1:40:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.64,1:40:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have seen your heart and it is mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.12,1:40:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have seen your dreams，Ronald Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.84,1:40:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I see your fears.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.26,1:40:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Least loved by your mother，who craved a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.04,1:40:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Least loved by the girl，who prefers your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.77,1:41:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，kill it！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.35,1:41:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were better without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.65,1:41:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.68,1:41:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who would look at you？Who has，Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.11,1:41:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you，compared to the chosen one？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.60,1:41:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，it's lying！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.09,1:41:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother confessed，she would prefer me as a son.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.09,1:41:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What woman would take you？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.27,1:41:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are nothing… nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.89,1:41:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing compared to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.14,1:42:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just think.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.13,1:42:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are only three to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.63,1:42:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.67,1:42:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.92,1:42:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is everything alright？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.92,1:42:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's fine。Actually，yeah，it's more than fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.90,1:43:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.70,1:43:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.24,1:43:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…A complete ass，Ronald Weasley！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.82,1:43:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You show up here after weeks and you say 'hey'？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.06,1:43:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's my wand，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.48,1:43:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's my wand？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.03,1:43:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter。You give me my wand！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.17,1:43:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How come he's got your wand？- Never mind why's he got my wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.35,1:43:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.59,1:43:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.88,1:43:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And how is it that you just
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.96,1:43:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,happen to have the sword of Gryffindor？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.02,1:43:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.29,1:43:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't think this changes anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.74,1:43:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course not。I only just destroyed a bloody Horcrux，
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.69,1:43:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,why will that change anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.07,1:43:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I wanted to come back as soon as I left.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.40,1:44:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just didn't know how to find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.67,1:44:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，how did you find us？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.07,1:44:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,With this。Doesn't just turn off lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.14,1:44:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how it works，
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.83,1:44:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,but Christmas morning I sleeping in this little pub.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.19,1:44:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keeping away from some snatchers.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.85,1:44:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When I heard it。- It？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.65,1:44:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.13,1:44:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your voice，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.41,1:44:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Comin' out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.18,1:44:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what exactly did I say if I may ask？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.56,1:44:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.55,1:44:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.32,1:44:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like a whisper.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.36,1:44:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I took it，clicked it…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.95,1:44:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,and this tiny ball of light appeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.10,1:44:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I knew，sure enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.03,1:44:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It floated towards me，the ball of light.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.45,1:44:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Went right to my chest，straight through me。Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.96,1:45:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew it was gonna take me where I needed to go，
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.18,1:45:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I disapparated.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.81,1:45:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came to this hillside.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.43,1:45:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was dark，I had no idea where I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.63,1:45:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just hoped that one of you would show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.70,1:45:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.24,1:45:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've always liked these flames Hermione makes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.26,1:45:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long do you reckon she'll stay mad at me？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.32,1:45:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep talking about that little ball of light touching your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.12,1:45:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And she'll come around。- It's true。Every word.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.97,1:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is gonna sound crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.04,1:45:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I think，thats why Dumbledore left it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.42,1:45:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Deluminator.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.92,1:46:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he knew that somehow I'd need to find my way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.33,1:46:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That she'd lead me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.71,1:46:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I just realized。You need a wand，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.56,1:46:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- I got one here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.39,1:46:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Blackthorn，10 inches，nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.29,1:46:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reckon it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.13,1:46:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Took it off a snatcher a couple of weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.22,1:46:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell Hermione this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.82,1:46:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're a bit dim，snatchers.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.29,1:46:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one is definitely partial to smelling.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.88,1:46:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Engorgio。- Put it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.98,1:46:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on in there？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.73,1:46:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nothing！- Nothing！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.87,1:46:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.63,1:46:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.36,1:46:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to go see Xenophilius Lovegood.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.05,1:46:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.70,1:46:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,See this？It's a letter Dumbledore wrote to Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.05,1:46:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at the signature.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.79,1:47:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the mark again.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.94,1:47:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It keeps cropping up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.38,1:47:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,In Beedle the Bard，in the graveyard in Godric's Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.18,1:47:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was there too.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.47,1:47:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where？- Outside Gregorvitch's wand shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.60,1:47:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What does it mean？- Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.07,1:47:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got no idea where the next Horcrux is，and neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.09,1:47:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this，this means something.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.58,1:47:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.48,1:47:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Hermione's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.92,1:47:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We ought to see Lovegood.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.83,1:47:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's vote on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.47,1:47:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those in favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.18,1:48:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not still mad at him，are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.08,1:48:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm always mad at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.85,1:48:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luna，we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.92,1:48:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep off the Dirigible Plums.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep off the Dirigible Plums.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.07,1:48:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.05,1:48:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.23,1:48:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Mr。Lovegood.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.16,1:48:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Harry Potter，we met a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.92,1:48:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we come in？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.46,1:48:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is Luna？- Luna？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.24,1:48:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll be along.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.80,1:49:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，how can I help you，Mr。Potter？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.87,1:49:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，actually，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.91,1:49:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,it was about something you were wearing around your neck at the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.29,1:49:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a symbol.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.05,1:49:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You mean this？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.13,1:49:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.62,1:49:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What we wondered is… what is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.03,1:49:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.72,1:49:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's the sign of the Deathly Hallows，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.83,1:49:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The What？- The What？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.52,1:49:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Deathly Hallows.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.45,1:49:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I assume you are all familiar with the tale of the three brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.64,1:49:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes… - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.48,1:49:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.59,1:49:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have it in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.22,1:50:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were once three brothers，
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.53,1:50:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,who were traveling along a lonely winding road…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.87,1:50:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- At twilight。- Midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.83,1:50:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom always said midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.99,1:50:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twilight's fine，better actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.72,1:50:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you want to read it？- Uh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.94,1:50:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were once three brothers，who were traveling along…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.72,1:50:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,a lonely winding road…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.45,1:50:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,At twilight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.05,1:50:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,In time the brothers reached
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.54,1:50:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,a river too treacherous to pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.89,1:50:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they were learned in the magical arts，
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.61,1:50:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,the three brothers simply waved their wands，and made a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.40,1:50:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before they could cross however，
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.57,1:51:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,they found their path blocked by a hooded figure.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.93,1:51:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Death.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.71,1:51:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he felt cheated.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.18,1:51:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheated，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.73,1:51:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,because travelers would always drown in the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.18,1:51:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Death was cunning.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.66,1:51:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,He pretended to congratulate the three brothers on their magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.49,1:51:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And said，that each had earned a prize for having
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.14,1:51:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,been clever enough to evade him.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.00,1:51:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The oldest asked for a wand，more powerful than any in existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.82,1:51:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,So death fashioned him a
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.12,1:51:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,wand from an elder tree that stood nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.53,1:51:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second brother decided he wanted to humiliate death even further，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.33,1:51:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,and asked for the power to recall loved ones from the grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.17,1:51:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,So Death plucked a stone from the river and offered it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.11,1:51:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally，Death turned to the third brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.23,1:51:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,A humble man，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.00,1:51:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,he asked for something that would allow him to go forth from that place，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.13,1:52:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,without being followed by death.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.43,1:52:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And so it was that death reluctantly handed over his own cloak of invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.07,1:52:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first brother traveled to a distant village.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.80,1:52:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,While with the elder wand in hand，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.85,1:52:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,he killed a wizard with whom he had once quarrels.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.97,1:52:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drunk with the power that the
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.61,1:52:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,elder wand had given him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.99,1:52:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He bragged of his invincibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.78,1:52:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that night…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.86,1:52:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another wizard stole the wand
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.47,1:52:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,and slit the brother's throat for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.84,1:52:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And so death took the first brother for his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.15,1:52:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second brother journeyed to his home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.86,1:52:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where he took the stone and turned it twice in hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.22,1:52:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,To his delight
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.41,1:52:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,the girl he'd once hoped to marry before her untimely death，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.13,1:52:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,appeared before him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.73,1:53:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yet soon she turned sad and cold
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.54,1:53:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,for she did not belong in the mortal world.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.26,1:53:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driven mad with hopeless longing，
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.14,1:53:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,the second brother killed himself so as to join her.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.72,1:53:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And so death took the second brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.85,1:53:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,As for the third brother，Death searched for many years
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.64,1:53:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,but was never able to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.19,1:53:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only when he had attained a great age did the youngest brother，
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.07,1:53:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,shed the cloak of invisibility and give it to his son.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.74,1:53:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,He then greeted death as a old friend
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.56,1:53:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,and went with him gladly departing this life as equals.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.05,1:53:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,So there you are。Those are the Deathly Hallows.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.15,1:53:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry sir，I still don't quite understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.76,1:54:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Elder wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.43,1:54:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,The most powerful wand ever made.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.15,1:54:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The resurrection stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.81,1:54:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cloak of invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.27,1:54:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Together，they make the Deathly Hallows.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.61,1:54:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Together，they make one master of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.15,1:54:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That mark was on the grave in Godrics Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.01,1:55:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，Mr。Lovegood，
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.19,1:55:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,does the Peverell family
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.18,1:55:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,have anything to do with the Deathly Hallows？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.27,1:55:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ignotus，excuse me。And his brothers Cadmus and Antioch，
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.36,1:55:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,thought to be the original owners of the Hallows，
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.54,1:55:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,and therefore the inspiration for the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.78,1:55:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,But your tea has gone cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.35,1:55:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.60,1:55:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.39,1:55:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to drink anymore of that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.34,1:55:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot or cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.03,1:55:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you，Sir。- You forgot the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.01,1:55:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Water？- For the tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.59,1:55:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,How silly of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.30,1:55:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's really nice sir，but we really should be going any way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.61,1:55:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you do not！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.80,1:56:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.03,1:56:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.51,1:56:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were angry，you see，from what I've been writing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.67,1:56:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So they took her.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.27,1:56:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,They took my children.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.20,1:56:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,My children.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.87,1:56:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's really you，then it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.11,1:56:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who took her，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.09,1:57:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.78,1:57:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got him！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.98,1:57:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Treacherous little bleeder！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.63,1:57:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there no one we can trust？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.91,1:57:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,They kidnapped her because he supported me.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.30,1:57:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was just desperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.22,1:57:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll do the enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.07,1:57:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.75,1:58:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，don't hang about。Snatch 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.08,1:59:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry。Tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.15,1:59:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.69,1:59:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grindelwald。Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.31,1:59:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come，one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.99,1:59:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But surely you must know.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.34,1:59:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I no longer have what you seek.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.14,1:59:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，Grindelwald，tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.05,1:59:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me who possesses it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.21,1:59:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The elder wand lies with him，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.49,1:59:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buried in the earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.57,1:59:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.47,2:00:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Hallows exist.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.17,2:00:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he's only after one of them，the last one.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.95,2:00:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows where it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.02,2:00:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna have it by the end of the night.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.32,2:00:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know who's had the elder wand？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.99,2:00:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't touch her！- Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.28,2:00:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your boyfriend will get much worse
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.26,2:00:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,than that if he doesn't learn to behave himself.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.09,2:00:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to you，ugly？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.27,2:00:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.57,2:00:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's your name？- Dudley。Vernon Dudley.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.95,2:00:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.69,2:00:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you，my lovely.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.07,2:00:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do they call you？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.64,2:00:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Penelope Clearwater，half-blood.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.03,2:00:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no Vernon Dudley on here.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.81,2:00:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear that ugly？This says you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.45,2:00:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,How come you don't want us to know who you are？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.65,2:01:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's wrong，I told you who I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.54,2:01:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Change of plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.83,2:01:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not taking this lot to the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.69,2:02:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.88,2:02:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.64,2:02:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.92,2:02:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look closely，son.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.99,2:02:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we are the ones to hand Potter over to the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.28,2:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything would be forgiven，
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.99,2:02:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,it would be as it was，understand？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.66,2:02:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we won't be forgetting who really actually caught him.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.41,2:02:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope，Mr。Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.37,2:02:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You dare to talk to me like that in my own house！- Lucius！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.28,2:02:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not be shy，sweetie。Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.41,2:02:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if this isn't who you think it is，Draco，
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.10,2:02:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we call Him。He'll kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.89,2:02:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to be absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.77,2:03:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's wrong with his face？- Yes，what is wrong with his face？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.48,2:03:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He came to us like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.10,2:03:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something he picked up in the forest，I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.01,2:03:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,An interesting jinx。Was it you，dear？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.64,2:03:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me her wand，
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.87,2:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,let's see what your last spell was.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.52,2:03:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.19,2:03:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.68,2:03:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that from？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.09,2:03:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was in her bag when we searched her.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.66,2:03:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reckon it's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.57,2:03:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mad？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.41,2:03:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out！Get out！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.46,2:03:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cissy，put the boys in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.12,2:04:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want a conversation with this one.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.18,2:04:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Girl to girl！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.69,2:04:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.31,2:04:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't leave Hermione alone with her.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.90,2:04:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.42,2:04:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.54,2:04:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luna？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.71,2:04:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That Sword is meant to be in my vault now，
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.75,2:04:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,how did you get it？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.62,2:04:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you and your friend's take it from my vault？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.66,2:04:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't take anything！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.10,2:04:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.11,2:04:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We have to do something！- There is no way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.57,2:04:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We tried everything。It's enchanted.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.53,2:05:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're bleeding，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.62,2:05:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a curious thing to keep on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.90,2:05:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help us！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.69,2:05:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let her go。- You go，get back！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.95,2:05:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，Goblin。Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.04,2:05:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby？What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.27,2:05:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby's come to rescue，Harry Potter of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.08,2:05:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby will always be there for Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.55,2:05:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you can apparate in and out of this room？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.11,2:06:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you take us with you？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.42,2:06:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，sir，I'm a elf.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.96,2:06:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.23,2:06:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Dobby，I want you to take Luna and Mr。Ollivander…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.21,2:06:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shell Cottage，on the outskirts of Tinworth.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.67,2:06:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.46,2:06:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,When ever you're ready，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.42,2:06:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？I like her very much！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.72,2:06:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet me at top of the stairs in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.69,2:06:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who gets his wand？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.71,2:06:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask you once more，goblin.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.93,2:06:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think very，very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.54,2:06:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How did they get there？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.29,2:07:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know？Why were you doing your job？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.82,2:07:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who got into my vault？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.22,2:07:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who stole it？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.53,2:07:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who… Stole it？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.14,2:07:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's impossible to break into Gringotts，the sword is there.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.23,2:07:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then how is it that it's out then？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.50,2:07:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no place safer，than Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.86,2:07:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Liar！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.67,2:07:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky，goblin.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.95,2:07:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The same won't be said for this one。- Like hell！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.54,2:07:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.47,2:07:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.31,2:07:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.35,2:07:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop your wands.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.91,2:07:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，drop them！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.76,2:07:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pick 'em up，Draco，now！Well，well，well.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.30,2:08:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.46,2:08:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.70,2:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's all bright，shiny and new again.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.90,2:08:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just in time for the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.03,2:08:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.94,2:08:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.63,2:08:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.73,2:09:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupid elf！You could have kill me！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.55,2:09:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby never meant to kill.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.60,2:09:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby only meant to maim or seriously injure.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.44,2:09:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,How dare you take a witch's wand.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.46,2:09:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,How dare you defy your masters.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.59,2:09:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby has no master.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.83,2:09:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby is a free elf.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.59,2:09:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Dobby has come to save Harry Potter and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.14,2:09:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.26,2:10:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're safe。We're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.87,2:10:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.86,2:10:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.18,2:10:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby，you're all right then，hold on.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.39,2:10:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on，okay？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.90,2:10:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just hold on，okay？We're going to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.51,2:10:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，you have something…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.23,2:10:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,In your bag。Hermione！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.90,2:10:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.81,2:10:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.45,2:10:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such a beautiful place，
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.39,2:10:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be with friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.61,2:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dobby is happy，
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.89,2:11:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be with be with his friend，
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.74,2:11:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.47,2:11:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should close his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.54,2:11:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.58,2:11:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,There，now he could be sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.23,2:11:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to bury him.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.10,2:12:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Properly，without magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 黑暗时期已经来临
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的世界面临着前所未有的威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要对我的人民说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 作为你们的公仆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,会一如既往地捍卫你们的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,击退那些企图压迫你们的黑恶力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的魔法部依旧强大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:19.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑魔标记传播着恐怖）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:22.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（麻瓜家庭惨遭杀害）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:25.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（食死徒数量大增）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 亲爱的 茶泡好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 达力 快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白 为什么非得走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这里不再安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 跟爸爸说晚餐快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她能应付这些事 - 她多棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一忘皆空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:40.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与死亡圣器（上）》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯 我正担心你迷路了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 给你留了个座位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该带来了些情报吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,下星期六 夜幕降临之时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 我听到的有所不同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个傲罗德力士无意中透漏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特要到30号 也就是他满17岁的前一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会转移
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条假情报
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗办公室不再参与
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护哈利·波特的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰社相信我们的人已经打入了魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,难得啊 他们总算弄对了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看 皮尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 乱花渐欲迷人眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕真相就在其中 也很难去伪存真
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话说得像个政客
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后会有你发挥的时候 皮尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打算把那男孩藏哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是某个凤凰社成员的家里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说他们已经采取了各种保护措施
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他到了那里 就很难再抓到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请缨参加这次行动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了那男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没跟你说过吗 让客人保持安静
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种杀戮的欲望很鼓舞人心 贝拉特里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但杀死哈利·波特的人 必须是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我面临一个难题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和波特的魔杖共用一个杖芯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从某种程度上来说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽能造成伤害 但杀不死对方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想干掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须用另一根魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你们中的一位会享此殊荣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样 卢修斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主人 - 「主人」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是榆木做的吗 - 是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杖芯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 龙心腱 主人 - 龙心腱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你们有些人还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们请到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑞迪·巴布吉教授
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她此前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在霍格沃茨魔法学校教魔法和巫术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的专长是麻瓜研究
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布吉教授相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻瓜与我们毫无差别
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她认为
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该与麻瓜通婚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,用她的话说 麻瓜与巫师通婚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应引以为耻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而值得鼓励
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳吉尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:22.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（讣文：怀念邓布利多）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:24.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（作者：埃非亚斯·多吉）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你看起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还用说 他绝对没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说趁敌人对他动手前 赶快行动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,金斯莱 你不是一直在保护麻瓜首相吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 哈利 比尔·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他平时没这么帅 - 冒失鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在威尔士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕了一个只灰背
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一天我会喜欢上它
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我眼里你还是那么帅 威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙蓉·比尔现在迷恋生牛排了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫就爱开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 一直想告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和莱姆斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 没时间聊家常了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里 越快越好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特 你还未成年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你身上仍带有踪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么踪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你打个喷嚏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法部就会知道谁给你擦的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是我们得用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,踪丝无法探测的方式转移
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞天扫帚 夜骐和飞天摩托 我们结对走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果食死徒准备伏击我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们肯定会来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们分不清哪个才是真正的哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很熟悉这种液体
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 绝对不行 - 我说过他会这反应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果你们认为
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让每个人为我冒生命危险…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 咱们之前又不是没干过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这次不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了它 变成我 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们才不喜欢呢 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下 如果出了什么岔子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就永远成为满脸雀斑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯疯癫癫的小笨蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的每个人都成年了 波特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们愿意冒这个险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确的说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被胁迫的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下是蒙顿格斯·弗莱彻 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,您最忠实的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 蒙顿格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐 依计而行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于那些没有喝过复方汤剂的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们一个忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来有点像妖精的尿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尝尿无数了是吧 疯眼汉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,活跃一下气氛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩一摸一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没有一件运动型的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太喜欢这个颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你你就穿 由不得你了 快换上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也得换 波特
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 头扭过去 我丑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.09,0:14:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道她说的那个纹身是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 你的视力真是糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们来分组
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个波特都有一个保护者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯 跟紧我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得盯着点你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而哈利… - 这
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的哈利 到底哪个是你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这 - 你和海格骑摩托
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我16年前送你来这时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有一只小史棘龙大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,解铃还须系铃人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多感人啊 出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地陋居 到那碰面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数到三 - 抓紧了 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你的右边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格 我们得回去帮他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯眼汉有命令
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:16:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.95,0:17:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 海格
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没人回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一出发就被食死徒攻击了 莫丽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无还手之力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你们俩没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,食死徒一直在等我们 他们早埋伏好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩和比尔早该回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸和弗雷德也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 进屋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:20:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利波特在霍格沃兹第一次拜访我的办公室时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间角落里的是什么生物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗 - 什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只格林迪洛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被出卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔知道我们今晚要转移你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得确定你是不是冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多最后对我们两个说的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.63,0:20:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利是我们最大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么脱身的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德薇来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想保护我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该好好抱抱他 太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要没他我早死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要这么大惊小怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最后一批吗 乔治呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 你感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像个圣人 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个圣人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变神圣了 我有洞了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界那么多关于耳朵的笑点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偏挑了个「我有洞了」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真衰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是比你帅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯眼汉死了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯一看见伏地魔就溜了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地陋居
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个 七个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魂器 - 它们可能藏在任何地方 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.22,0:23:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂裂于七块
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们摧毁了所有的魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能最终击败伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要骗我 不要骗我 - 不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.06,0:24:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不会有人牺牲了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我而牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.55,0:24:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.41,0:24:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为疯眼汉为你而死
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:24:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为乔治为你而伤
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.47,0:24:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你就是那个救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比什么都重要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来吧 - 撇下赫敏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.25,0:24:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有她咱们撑不了两天
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟她说我说过这话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你身上还带着踪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还得参加婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.54,0:24:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎一个婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.81,0:24:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不管是谁的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.75,0:24:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须开始寻找魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一击败他的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.93,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们在这待得越久 他就会越强大
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 今晚还不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.74,0:25:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会正中他的下怀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.85,0:25:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.55,0:25:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些魂器是他的灵魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.67,0:25:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.32,0:25:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当邓布利多毁了那枚戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你摧毁汤姆·里德尔的日记的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定能感到些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.33,0:25:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要毁掉剩下的魂器 得先找到它们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.38,0:25:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从何处着手
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.28,0:26:07.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（比尔和芙蓉）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.47,0:26:15.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《邓布利多的黑暗面》 丽塔·斯基特新著）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.47,0:26:32.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《追忆邓布利多》 埃非亚斯·多吉著）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.47,0:26:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拉上好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.85,0:26:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很傻吧 我是说举办婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.30,0:26:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了这么多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.07,0:27:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能这就是举行婚礼最好的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切还要继续
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.38,0:27:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那边怎么样了 小伙子们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 魔法部长来搞毛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.81,0:28:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长大人来此有何贵干
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个问题你我都心知肚明 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我将宣读
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿布思·珀西瓦尔·伍尔弗里克·布赖恩·邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的遗嘱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.87,0:28:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我要把熄灯器留给
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.39,0:28:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩·比利斯·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.78,0:28:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我自己做的一个小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它能在最黑暗的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.23,0:29:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给罗恩带来光明
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邓布利多把这个留给我 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这怎么使 - 打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.62,0:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太帅了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:37.61,Title,0,0,0,0,,将我珍藏的《诗翁彼豆故事集》
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.66,0:29:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给赫敏·简·格兰杰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望她能从书中找到乐趣和启发
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈以前常给我读
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵和魔力壶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭比兔与话唠树桩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 芭比兔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.83,0:30:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.06,0:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·詹姆斯·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.32,0:30:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,将得到这只金色飞贼
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.87,0:30:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他在霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次参加魁地奇比赛时抓到的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以时刻提醒他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.47,0:30:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,毅力和技巧的回报
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.65,0:30:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.15,0:30:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.91,0:30:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多还留给你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.33,0:30:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二件遗物
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.61,0:30:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈德里克·格兰芬多之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.27,0:30:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 邓布利多没有权利
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.67,0:30:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,将格兰芬多之剑赠予他人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:31:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一件贵重的历史文物 它属于…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.14,0:31:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.06,0:31:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它属于哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在密室里 当哈利最需要的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它选择了哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.46,0:31:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当遇到格莱芬多的杰出学生时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.19,0:31:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝剑就会出现 格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不表示它属于那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,更何况
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没人知道宝剑在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.53,0:31:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.69,0:31:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你接下来要做什么 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.37,0:31:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.41,0:31:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太强大了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.05,0:32:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.27,0:32:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打扰了你的沉思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.51,0:32:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你的眼睛里看得出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有 你好吗 卢娜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.98,0:32:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.78,0:32:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被地精咬了一口 大拇指失去知觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.06,0:32:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,地精唾液可大有裨益哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.44,0:32:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢诺菲留斯·洛夫古德
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住在山上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:52.68,Title,0,0,0,0,,相信波特先生知道我们的《唱唱反调》
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.72,0:32:54.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,跟《预言家日报》对着干
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.94,0:32:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在邓布利多在世时和他去世后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.11,0:33:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,都全力支持他 也全力支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.54,0:33:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了爸爸 哈利现在不想跟我们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.17,0:33:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是怕有失礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.31,0:33:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能坐吗 - 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.69,0:33:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.02,0:33:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了你在预言家日报上写的文章
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.49,0:33:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.50,0:33:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定 很了解邓布利多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.22,0:33:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他的时间最长了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.16,0:33:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了他弟弟阿不福思外
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.34,0:33:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 好像从没人记起过阿不福思
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道他还有个弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.49,0:33:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多一直独来独往 从小就是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.91,0:33:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惆怅了 埃菲亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.15,0:33:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔·斯基特曝光了他的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,书有800页厚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:33:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.74,0:34:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人向她透露了些秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.80,0:34:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个与邓布利多家族关系密切的人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩都知道这指的是谁吧 埃菲亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.43,0:34:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是可耻的背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.79,0:34:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 这个人是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.28,0:34:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴希尔达·巴肖特
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.66,0:34:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 孩子 她可是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.45,0:34:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个世纪最著名的魔法史家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.70,0:34:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是邓布利多的老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.26,0:34:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔·斯基特肯定觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.96,0:34:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很值得去一趟戈德里克山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.30,0:34:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜访一下那个老不啦叽的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈德里克山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.18,0:34:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴希尔达·巴肖特住在戈德里克山谷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.37,0:34:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是在那认识邓布利多的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.65,0:34:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是说邓布利多也住在那吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.20,0:34:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爸爸杀了那三个麻瓜后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.88,0:34:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,全家就搬了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.72,0:34:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是当时很大的丑闻
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:34:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.34,0:35:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的了解邓布利多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.44,0:35:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法部垮台了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.15,0:35:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法部长死了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.18,0:35:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.62,0:35:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.35,0:35:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,后会有期了 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.23,0:36:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.62,0:36:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,舍夫茨别利路
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.15,0:36:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前常和爸妈来这看戏
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.98,0:36:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道怎么想到的 它突然就蹦了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.18,0:36:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.81,0:36:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得换身衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.81,0:36:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.81,0:36:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空间扩增咒 - 你真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.61,0:36:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活充满着惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:36:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就是那堆书了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.98,0:37:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼上的人怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.15,0:37:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是该回去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.05,0:37:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 他们冲你来的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.39,0:37:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去的话 大家都会有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩说的对 - 要什么咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一杯卡布奇诺 - 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.72,0:37:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和她一样 - 一样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.98,0:37:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在去哪 破釜酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.60,0:37:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.56,0:37:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果伏地魔控制了魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.31,0:37:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没哪是安全的了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.79,0:37:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼上的人也都该躲起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.06,0:37:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的包还在陋居 东西都在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.14,0:37:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.91,0:37:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几天前就把必需品装包里了 以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.14,0:38:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我最喜欢的牛仔裤怎么没带上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.28,0:38:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.60,0:38:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统石化
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.45,0:38:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.67,0:38:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上门 熄掉灯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是罗尔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.67,0:38:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多被杀的那晚 他也在占星塔上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.27,0:38:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是多罗霍夫
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.21,0:38:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在通缉布告上见过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:38:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么处置你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,反过来 你们会杀了我们对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们的话 食死徒就知道我们在哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.46,0:39:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩 - 没准是他杀的疯眼汉呢 你还那么想吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹去他们的记忆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了算 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.13,0:39:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔咒什么的你最拿手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.30,0:39:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一忘皆空
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.00,0:39:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么找到我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.61,0:39:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能还带着踪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 十七岁踪丝就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.62,0:40:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.09,0:40:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没给你过生日呢 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.38,0:40:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和金妮还准备了个蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.23,0:40:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备在婚礼结束时拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.27,0:40:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.95,0:40:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的好意我心领了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.29,0:40:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是看看刚才 我们差点被几个食死徒杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.17,0:40:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是先别想这个了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.71,0:40:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是 说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.35,0:40:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们别在街上晃悠了 找个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.37,0:41:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是疯眼汉的主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.96,0:41:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止斯内普偷摸进来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.28,0:41:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人形显身
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.96,0:41:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有别人了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.14,0:41:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,换一根魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 再换一根就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.77,0:41:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有别的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.42,0:43:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.70,0:43:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面黑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.67,0:43:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷古勒斯·阿克图勒斯·布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.29,0:43:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.59,0:43:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你读到这个之时 我早已死去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.09,0:43:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷走了真的魂器 并想销毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.52,0:43:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,R.A.B 是小天狼星的弟弟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.17,0:43:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题是他没能摧毁真正的魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直暗中监视我们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.97,0:44:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,克利切 一直在旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.77,0:44:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他知道真的魂器在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.71,0:44:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前见过这个东西吗 克利切
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.66,0:44:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是雷古勒斯少爷的挂坠盒 - 当时有两个 对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.72,0:44:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,克利切不知道另一个挂坠盒在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.90,0:44:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你以前见过吗 它就在这所房子里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.91,0:44:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,肮脏的泥巴种 还有血统背叛者韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.22,0:44:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答她的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.90,0:44:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.18,0:44:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它曾经就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.35,0:45:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这屋中
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.86,0:45:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这邪恶的物件
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.37,0:45:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.88,0:45:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷古勒斯少爷死前 命令克利切销毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.51,0:45:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但试遍了所有的办法都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.55,0:45:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人拿走了吗 - 他那天晚上来到这
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.26,0:45:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,连带着挂坠盒拿走了很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.38,0:45:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 谁拿走的 克利切
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.49,0:45:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.38,0:45:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯·弗莱奇
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.99,0:45:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.08,0:46:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸饶不了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.87,0:46:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭桶们 他不在这
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.95,0:46:29.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哈利波特：头号不良分子）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.35,0:46:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为你们的新任魔法部长
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.87,0:46:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承诺将给这恢弘的大厅
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.51,0:46:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,带回往昔的荣耀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.87,0:46:41.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（魔法即强权）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.20,0:46:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此从今天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.20,0:46:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,每位职员都必须接受
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.31,0:46:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,血统评估
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.61,0:46:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 如果你没什么可隐瞒的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.16,0:46:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就应无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.34,0:47:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,金色飞贼有肉体记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.74,0:48:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克林杰给你的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.17,0:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想 它一碰到你的手就会打开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.93,0:48:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多可能在里面藏了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.14,0:48:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特 好久不见了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.58,0:48:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.48,0:48:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.46,0:48:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们玩得什么把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.85,0:48:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一对家养小精灵跟踪我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.93,0:48:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比只是想帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.94,0:48:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比在对角巷看到克利切的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.51,0:48:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比很好奇他怎么会来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.53,0:48:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后多比就听到他提到哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.02,0:48:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后多比看到克利切和那个贼说话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.24,0:48:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是贼 你这小…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.82,0:48:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂种
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.37,0:49:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是转手一些珍贵奇妙的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.64,0:49:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个贼 顿格 大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.49,0:49:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦斯莱少爷 见到你真高兴 - 鞋子不错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.76,0:49:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我那天晚上紧张极了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.34,0:49:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯眼汉跌落扫帚 我有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.51,0:49:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.76,0:49:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这翻个底朝天的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.35,0:49:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.29,0:49:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了个挂坠盒 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.49,0:49:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 很值钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.03,0:49:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 他担心卖的钱太少了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.91,0:49:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是忍痛割爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.41,0:49:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我在对角巷兜售货物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.25,0:49:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然有个魔法部的女巫过来要看我的许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.20,0:49:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说没有的话就把我关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.79,0:49:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是她突然看上那个挂坠盒 我就真被关起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.37,0:49:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁 你认识她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.71,0:49:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:50:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她 瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.62,0:50:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没错
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.42,0:50:13.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（魔法部寻求教育改革）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 记住我们之前说好的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非迫不得已 不要跟任何人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.87,0:50:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量表现得正常点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.21,0:50:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,依葫芦画瓢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样运气好的话 我们就能进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.81,0:51:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后 - 随机应变了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.23,0:51:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.42,0:51:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这真是疯了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.46,0:51:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界本疯癫 喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.69,0:51:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去找魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.54,0:51:42.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（男厕所）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.01,0:52:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把自己冲进去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.34,0:52:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.22,0:52:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 过来 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.66,0:52:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.96,0:53:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些是 - 麻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.26,0:53:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们该待的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.50,0:53:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我有点崩溃了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.21,0:53:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这个复方汤剂药效有多久来着 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.02,0:53:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.25,0:53:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特莫尔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.20,0:53:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办公室还在下雨呢 两天了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.83,0:53:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,试过撑把伞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.61,0:53:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我正要去楼下吧 卡特莫尔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.09,0:53:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楼下 - 审问你妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.94,0:53:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人怀疑我妻子的血统
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.21,0:53:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.63,0:54:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律执行司的头有个活要做
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.07,0:54:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会把它当做头等大事去办
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.21,0:54:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.95,0:54:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.79,0:54:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子一人在楼下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.97,0:54:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 你哪来的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.72,0:54:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.72,0:54:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二层
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.29,0:54:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但怎么让雨停下来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.63,0:54:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试咒立停
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.87,0:54:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到了 罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.16,0:54:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒立停 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.33,0:54:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没效果怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.37,0:55:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果一小时内没找到乌姆里奇
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.47,0:55:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就跟罗恩回去 改天再来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.56,0:55:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行吗 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.75,0:55:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,马法尔达 特雷弗派你过来的是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.67,0:55:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们下楼去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.08,0:55:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伯特 你不出去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.22,0:55:54.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险的泥巴种）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.09,0:56:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦考恩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.82,0:56:10.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多洛雷斯·乌姆里奇 魔法部高级副部长）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.44,0:56:14.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（麻瓜出身登记委员会主任）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.54,0:56:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂坠盒飞来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.43,0:57:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了 冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.62,0:57:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续工作好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.06,0:57:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.13,0:58:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦考恩
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.48,0:58:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.07,0:58:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩 是我 - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.73,0:58:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我都忘你什么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.75,0:58:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.73,0:58:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟乌姆里奇到楼下法庭去了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.55,0:58:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里冷死了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.78,0:58:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是混血 我爸 我爸是巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.82,0:58:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·沃登顿 在这工作30年了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.31,0:58:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没准记得 老是反穿夹克的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.46,0:58:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.37,0:58:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟魔法部说 我必须回去工作 我是混血
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.72,0:59:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·伊丽莎白·卡特莫尔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.19,0:59:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇斯尔赫斯特花园27号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.99,0:59:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 就是这
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.28,0:59:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅齐 埃利和阿尔弗雷德的母亲 雷吉纳德的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.45,0:59:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.83,0:59:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 艾伯特
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.38,0:59:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·伊丽莎白·卡特莫尔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.22,0:59:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.40,0:59:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特莫尔太太 你今天抵达魔法部时
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.80,0:59:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,被收走了一根魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.25,0:59:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这根吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.76,0:59:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.58,0:59:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从谁那里抢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.63,1:00:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有抢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.11,1:00:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十一岁的时候在对角巷奥利凡德那买的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.23,1:00:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它选择了我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.24,1:00:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.76,1:00:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖只选择巫师 而你不是巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.33,1:00:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.80,1:00:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉 告诉他们我是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.68,1:00:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我是巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.67,1:00:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟想干嘛 艾伯特
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.30,1:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在撒谎 多洛雷斯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.69,1:00:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以撒谎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.73,1:01:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 是哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.36,1:01:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他 这下跟孩子们可有故事讲了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.11,1:01:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼神护卫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.46,1:01:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.02,1:01:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.96,1:01:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去那找你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.77,1:01:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,国内待不下去了 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.37,1:01:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 照我说的做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.06,1:02:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.90,1:02:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.92,1:02:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长 见到你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.25,1:02:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利·波特 - 是哈利 哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.25,1:03:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.14,1:04:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 哈利 快点 在我包里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个瓶子上写着白鲜香精
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.77,1:04:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.29,1:04:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,香精飞来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.44,1:04:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开瓶子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.42,1:04:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 他的胳膊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.81,1:04:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 快打开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.73,1:04:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能 可能会有点痛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.37,1:04:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我以为
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.33,1:04:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们不是要回格里莫广场的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.14,1:04:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是 再来一点 再来一点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.81,1:04:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了 但是亚克斯利抓住了我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一旦知道了咱们去哪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.67,1:04:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方就没法待了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.36,1:04:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就把你们带到这来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.28,1:04:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩被分体了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.95,1:05:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统加护
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.70,1:05:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 平安镇守 - 你在干吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.95,1:05:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护魔咒
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.41,1:05:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想再像舍夫茨别利路那
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰上几个不速之客了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.11,1:05:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把帐篷拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.50,1:05:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帐篷
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.49,1:05:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 统统加护 - 帐篷在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.32,1:05:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻瓜屏蔽 闭耳塞听
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.47,1:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.88,1:06:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰熊熊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.36,1:06:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞沙走石
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.66,1:06:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,四分五裂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.13,1:06:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.50,1:06:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.97,1:07:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找到毁掉它的方法前 我们得保管好它
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.91,1:07:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点奇怪啊 哥们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.06,1:07:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多让你去找魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.13,1:07:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却没告诉你怎么毁掉它们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.91,1:07:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.04,1:07:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那个咒语 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.24,1:07:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 格里戈维奇 - 他从我这偷走的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.10,1:08:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小偷是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.50,1:08:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男孩 被他拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.80,1:08:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也没见过他 我以生命起誓
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.00,1:08:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.01,1:08:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.48,1:08:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦做完了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.11,1:08:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能一直让他这样侵入你的大脑
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.60,1:08:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神秘人找到了格里戈维奇 - 那个魔杖匠人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.72,1:08:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要一个格里戈维奇以前拥有的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.18,1:09:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是什么 但是他迫切地想拿到手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.12,1:09:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛那东西承载着他的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.30,1:09:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 有助他恢复
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.04,1:09:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我浑身发毛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.48,1:09:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想听到什么好消息吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.29,1:09:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该只是不想听到坏消息
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.73,1:09:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有多久才能移形
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.05,1:09:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我尽力了 - 还不够
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.31,1:09:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.01,1:09:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 马上拿下来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.59,1:09:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好点了吗 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.81,1:09:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们轮流戴吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.51,1:10:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯·斯内普被选为霍格沃茨魔法学校校长
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.63,1:11:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.42,1:11:10.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（校长办公室）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.56,1:11:12.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西弗勒斯·斯内普）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.20,1:11:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么味道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.41,1:12:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛 东西沉死了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.69,1:12:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 要我帮忙拿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.16,1:12:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,掠夺贼
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.85,1:12:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他闻到了我的香水
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.66,1:12:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.00,1:12:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩还无法驾驭幻影移形
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.92,1:12:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就走去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.64,1:12:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次不管你多想喷香水
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.08,1:12:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都克制点别用
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.24,1:13:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在播报失踪巫师名单
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.07,1:13:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是已确认名单
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.69,1:13:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所幸的是 今天的名单很短
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.28,1:13:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森 艾莉森·邓布莱特
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.35,1:13:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.04,1:13:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 詹克 查里 麦基·法利
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.13,1:13:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔·拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.37,1:13:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉诺·莎拉·吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.27,1:13:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 布朗温·崔格
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.33,1:13:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗勃 艾利·道森
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.30,1:13:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治亚·德·克莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.61,1:13:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚·佛莱克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.59,1:13:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治·库塔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.00,1:13:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加布里埃拉 艾米丽·马瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.89,1:13:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 米·厄兰
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.90,1:13:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉和布莱恩·加拉格尔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.61,1:14:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道自己在做什么 是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.53,1:14:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.54,1:14:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 詹姆斯·克里克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.58,1:14:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔希·瓦伦丁·施罗德
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.07,1:14:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗·温斯顿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.18,1:14:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔姆辛 约拉·希里克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.55,1:14:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.07,1:14:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.65,1:14:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.64,1:14:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰芬多剑 是妖精做的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.91,1:14:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.99,1:15:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没听懂
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.61,1:15:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥土和铁锈不会沾染剑锋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.15,1:15:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只会吸收能增强自己力量的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.90,1:15:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.54,1:15:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 我们不是已经摧毁了一个魂器吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.07,1:15:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔密室里的日记
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.72,1:15:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,用的是蛇怪的毒牙
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.36,1:15:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我你那血迹斑斑的珠绣包里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.47,1:15:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有根毒牙
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.25,1:15:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.59,1:15:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在密室里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.44,1:15:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用格兰芬多剑杀死了蛇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.32,1:15:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的刀刃沾染了蛇怪的毒液
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.91,1:15:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只会吸收增强自己力量的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.14,1:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 这就是为什么 - 它能摧毁魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.83,1:15:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是邓不利多遗嘱的本意
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.91,1:15:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太聪明了 赫敏 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.42,1:15:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是因为我的逻辑
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.01,1:15:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我把无关细节联系起来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.74,1:15:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且能观察到别人忽略的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.81,1:15:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但有个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.54,1:16:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑被偷了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.03,1:16:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我还在这
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.32,1:16:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩继续
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.70,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别因为我扫了兴
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.66,1:16:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没怎么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.56,1:16:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样就怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.49,1:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想说什么 别藏着掖着
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.52,1:16:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.72,1:16:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我可就说了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.07,1:16:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为咱们现在要去找另一个鬼玩意了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.49,1:16:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能开心点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.84,1:16:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你知道此行的目的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.60,1:16:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想来着
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.41,1:16:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我有点不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.88,1:16:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底哪一点让你不满意了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.51,1:16:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是认为我们该住五星级酒店
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.72,1:16:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天打渔两天晒网
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.52,1:16:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还盼着回家和老妈过圣诞节是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.60,1:16:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得 都这么久了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.07,1:16:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该有点进展
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.38,1:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.69,1:16:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多应该告诉过你一些有价值的信息
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.95,1:16:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你有计划
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.70,1:16:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多和我说的我都告诉你了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.32,1:16:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们已经找到了一块魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.95,1:17:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了一个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.72,1:17:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就万事大吉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.83,1:17:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 把魂器取下来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.71,1:17:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没整天戴着这个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.61,1:17:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.20,1:17:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我为什么每晚都要听广播吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.91,1:17:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想确认名单上没有金妮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.90,1:17:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德 乔治 还有我妈
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.97,1:17:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我没听吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.81,1:17:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道这什么感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.43,1:17:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.84,1:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母死了 你没有家人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.60,1:17:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打了 停下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.82,1:17:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我走 - 你走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.47,1:17:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.32,1:17:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.78,1:17:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走还是留下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.37,1:18:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 我那晚看见你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.56,1:18:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 我和他之间没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.06,1:18:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.77,1:18:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 你去哪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.49,1:18:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.66,1:18:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.82,1:18:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.07,1:19:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,平安镇守
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.77,1:22:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在结局开启
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.44,1:22:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.10,1:22:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 金色飞贼有肉体记忆
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.22,1:23:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次不是用手抓住的它
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.30,1:23:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点把它吞了下去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.28,1:23:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在结局开启 - 是的 这什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.96,1:23:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有新发现
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.73,1:23:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为这是个眼睛的图片 但现在发现不是
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.31,1:23:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是魔文 也不在发音表里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.96,1:23:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用墨水画的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.52,1:23:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是书里的内容 是有人画的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.42,1:23:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔和芙蓉婚礼上 卢娜爸爸身上也戴了这标志
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.58,1:23:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在儿童书上画这个
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.53,1:23:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 我一直在想
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.49,1:23:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去高锥克山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.78,1:23:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那出生 我父母也是在那死的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.11,1:23:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方对你如此特别
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.23,1:24:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定料到你会去那
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.53,1:24:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他也一样重要 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.47,1:24:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘人差点死在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.58,1:24:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把魂器藏在那
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.53,1:24:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不正合他意吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…太危险了 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.49,1:24:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不得不承认
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.73,1:24:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近也一直在想 得去那一趟
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.71,1:24:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有样东西可能也藏在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.74,1:24:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果邓不利多想让你找到
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.72,1:24:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时不希望落入魔法部之手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.70,1:24:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.07,1:24:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,会比格兰芬多的出生地更好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.24,1:24:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.26,1:24:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后别让我给你剪头发了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.44,1:25:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们还是该喝复方汤剂的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.16,1:25:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是我出生的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.94,1:25:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想扮成别人重返故乡
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.27,1:25:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 今天好像是平安夜
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.35,1:25:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.52,1:25:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们在里面吗 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.90,1:25:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.61,1:25:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.47,1:26:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊格诺图斯·佩弗利尔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.17,1:26:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.88,1:26:49.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（詹姆士·波特与莉莉·波特）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.18,1:27:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.56,1:27:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.74,1:27:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 有人正盯着我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.56,1:27:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂那边
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.40,1:28:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.70,1:28:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得不妥 哈利 - 赫敏 她认识邓不利多
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.49,1:28:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑可能在她那里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.13,1:28:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这死的 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.22,1:28:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他杀死他们的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.20,1:28:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是巴希达吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.90,1:29:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.02,1:29:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴沙特太太 这个男人是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.40,1:29:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.91,1:30:13.25,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《阿不思·邓不利多传》 丽塔·斯基特著）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.62,1:31:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.10,1:33:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好点了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.22,1:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次移形成功了 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.04,1:33:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是迪恩森林
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.18,1:33:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前我和爸妈来过这
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.17,1:33:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我记忆里的一模一样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.51,1:33:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,树林 小河 一切
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.81,1:33:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都如同没变一般
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.01,1:33:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实不是 一切都变了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.58,1:33:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我现在带父母回来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.38,1:33:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也未必能认出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.90,1:33:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,树林不在
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.09,1:33:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小河不在
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.66,1:33:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不再是那个我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.00,1:33:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们就该待在这 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.82,1:34:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢老去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.96,1:34:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道照片里的男孩是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.96,1:34:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.20,1:34:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉莱特·格林德沃
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.70,1:34:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他在格里戈维奇的魔杖商店偷东西
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.74,1:34:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我的魔杖哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.73,1:34:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的魔杖呢 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.87,1:34:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开高锥克山谷的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.42,1:34:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我施咒不小心击中了它
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.92,1:34:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.84,1:34:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了 但魔杖没那么容易修好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.49,1:34:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.42,1:34:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,先用你的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.42,1:35:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进去取暖
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.84,1:35:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂坠也给我来戴
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.93,1:36:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,荧光闪烁
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.64,1:37:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝剑飞来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.69,1:37:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,四分五裂
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.99,1:39:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.39,1:39:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.45,1:39:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.35,1:39:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很明显吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.66,1:39:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你召唤出那雌鹿的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.44,1:39:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我以为是你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.79,1:39:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的守护神是一只雄鹿
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.30,1:39:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 刚那头有…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.84,1:39:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 罗恩 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.91,1:39:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能碰它
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.74,1:39:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你和赫敏更容易受它影响
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.01,1:39:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说废话了 - 不 我不能
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.07,1:39:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.47,1:39:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.24,1:40:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我用蛇佬腔让它打开
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.48,1:40:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦打开 别迟疑
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.07,1:40:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道里面是什么 但肯定有一场恶战
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.26,1:40:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,日记中的神秘人想杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.28,1:40:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.48,1:40:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.34,1:40:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.64,1:40:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾见过你的心 它是属于我的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.12,1:40:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾见过你的梦 罗恩·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.84,1:40:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾见过你的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.26,1:40:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲的爱予你最少 她更希望是个女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.04,1:40:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,心上人之爱予你最少 她更爱你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.77,1:41:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 快刺
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.35,1:41:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你我们会更好
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.65,1:41:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,更开心
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.68,1:41:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了哈利·波特 谁会看你一眼
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.11,1:41:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和被选中的人相比 你算什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.60,1:41:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩 它在说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.09,1:41:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈跟我说过 更希望我做她的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.09,1:41:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个女人会喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.27,1:41:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他相比一无是处
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.89,1:41:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一无是处
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.14,1:42:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.13,1:42:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下三个了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.63,1:42:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.67,1:42:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.92,1:42:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.92,1:42:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 应该是好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.90,1:43:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.70,1:43:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.24,1:43:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩·韦斯莱 十足的大混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.82,1:43:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了几个星期 回来就说声 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.06,1:43:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的魔杖呢 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.48,1:43:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的魔杖呢 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.03,1:43:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特 把魔杖给我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.17,1:43:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么拿你的魔杖 - 关你什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.35,1:43:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.59,1:43:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摧毁了魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.88,1:43:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会拿到
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.96,1:43:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰芬多剑的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.02,1:43:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.29,1:43:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为这样我就会饶了你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.74,1:43:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会 我只是摧毁了一个魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.69,1:43:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不会原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.07,1:43:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚走就后悔了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.40,1:44:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不知道上哪找你们
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.67,1:44:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.07,1:44:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 不只能熄灯
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.14,1:44:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道它是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.83,1:44:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但圣诞节早上 我睡在一个小酒馆
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.19,1:44:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避那些掠夺贼
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.85,1:44:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听到它 - 它
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.65,1:44:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个声音
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.13,1:44:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.41,1:44:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里面发出来
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.18,1:44:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我都说了些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.56,1:44:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.55,1:44:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.32,1:44:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是轻声低语
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.36,1:44:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我拿出来 打开
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.95,1:44:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了一个小小的蓝色光球
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.10,1:44:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道了 非常肯定
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.03,1:44:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小光球向我飘来
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.45,1:44:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,落入了我的胸膛 就从这里
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.96,1:45:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它会把我带到想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.18,1:45:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了幻影移形
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.81,1:45:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就到了山的这边
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.43,1:45:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时很黑 我不知道身处何地
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.63,1:45:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望你们当中有谁能出现
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.70,1:45:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.24,1:45:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很喜欢赫敏造的小火苗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.26,1:45:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她还要生我的气多久
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.32,1:45:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,多说几遍那个小光球融入你心的故事
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.12,1:45:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她的气就消了 - 千真万确
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.97,1:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能听起来不可思议
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.04,1:45:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想这就是邓不利多把它给我的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.42,1:45:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个熄灯器
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.92,1:46:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我可能需要找到回来的路
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.33,1:46:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将为我指明道路
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.71,1:46:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚想到 你需要根魔杖是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.56,1:46:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 我这有一根
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.39,1:46:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑刺李木的 十英寸 没什么特别之处
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.29,1:46:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还能用
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.13,1:46:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,几星期前从一个掠夺贼那抢的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.22,1:46:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让赫敏知道
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.82,1:46:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,掠夺贼有点傻
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.29,1:46:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但嗅觉非常灵敏
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.88,1:46:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 速速变大 - 快弄灭
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.98,1:46:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.73,1:46:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.87,1:46:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.63,1:46:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.36,1:46:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去找谢诺菲留斯·洛夫古德
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.05,1:46:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.70,1:46:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 这是邓不利多写给格林德瓦的信
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.05,1:46:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个签名
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.79,1:47:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是这个符号
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.94,1:47:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它时时闪现
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.38,1:47:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在诗翁彼豆故事集里 在高锥克山谷的墓地
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.18,1:47:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那也有
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.47,1:47:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪 - 格里戈维奇的魔杖店外
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.60,1:47:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它代表什么意思 - 听着
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.07,1:47:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都不知道下个魂器在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.09,1:47:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个 这个一定代表着什么
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.58,1:47:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分确定
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.48,1:47:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 赫敏说的对极了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.92,1:47:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去见见洛夫古德
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.83,1:47:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是投票表决吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.47,1:47:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意的举手
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.18,1:48:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会还在生他的气吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.08,1:48:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候让我省过心
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.85,1:48:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢娜 我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.92,1:48:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰飞艇李
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.94,1:48:20.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《唱唱反调》主编 谢·洛夫古德）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰飞艇李
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.07,1:48:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.05,1:48:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.23,1:48:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好 洛夫古德先生
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.16,1:48:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是哈利·波特 我们几个月前见过
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.92,1:48:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能进来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.46,1:48:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卢娜去哪了 - 卢娜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.24,1:48:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一会儿就来
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.80,1:49:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮您先什么呢 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.87,1:49:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.91,1:49:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于你在婚礼上戴在脖子上的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.29,1:49:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个标志
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.05,1:49:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说这个吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.13,1:49:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.62,1:49:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想知道 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.03,1:49:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.72,1:49:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还用说 死亡圣器的标志啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.83,1:49:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.52,1:49:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡圣器
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.45,1:49:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们都熟悉三兄弟的传说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.64,1:49:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.48,1:49:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.59,1:49:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里面有
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.22,1:50:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前有三兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.53,1:50:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一条僻静的羊肠小道上赶路
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.87,1:50:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天色已近黄昏 - 是午夜
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.83,1:50:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈一直说是午夜
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.99,1:50:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄昏也不错 实际上更好
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.72,1:50:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想来念吗 - 你念就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.94,1:50:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前有三兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.72,1:50:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一条僻静的羊肠小道上赶路
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.45,1:50:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天色已近黄昏
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.05,1:50:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久 三兄弟来到一条河边
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.54,1:50:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,河水太险 无法渡过
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.89,1:50:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但三兄弟精通魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.61,1:50:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只挥了下魔杖 就变出了一座桥
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.40,1:50:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而他们正准备过桥时
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.57,1:51:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,却发现一个戴兜帽的身影挡住了去路
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.93,1:51:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是死神
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.71,1:51:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得被欺骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.18,1:51:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.73,1:51:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行者通常会淹死于此
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.18,1:51:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但死神很狡猾
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.66,1:51:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他假装称赞三兄弟的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.49,1:51:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说 他们凭着聪明才智躲过了死神
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.14,1:51:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人可以获得一个奖励
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.00,1:51:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大想要一根天底下最强大的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.82,1:51:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此死神就用旁边的一棵接骨木树
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.12,1:51:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他做了根魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.53,1:51:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老二决定继续羞辱死神
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.33,1:51:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想拥有能让死去的爱人复活的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.17,1:51:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此死神就从河里变了块石头给他
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.11,1:51:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 死神转向老三
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.23,1:51:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老三很谦逊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.00,1:51:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要一件能让他离开那里
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.13,1:52:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不会被死神跟随的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.43,1:52:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神极不情愿地 把自己的隐形斗篷给了他
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.07,1:52:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大来到了一个遥远的山村
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.80,1:52:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那根接骨木做成的老魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.85,1:52:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死了一个与他不合的巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.97,1:52:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖赋予他的魔力令他欣喜若狂
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.61,1:52:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝得酩酊大醉
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.99,1:52:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他四处炫耀自己的无敌威力
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.78,1:52:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就在那晚
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.86,1:52:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个巫师偷走了魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.47,1:52:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并割断了他的喉咙
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.84,1:52:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样死神取走了老大的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.15,1:52:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老二旅行回家
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.86,1:52:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿出复活石并且在手里转了两次
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.22,1:52:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,令他欣喜的是
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.41,1:52:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾想迎娶却不幸早逝的女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.13,1:52:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在了他身前
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.73,1:53:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不久她就变得悲伤难耐 心灰意冷
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.54,1:53:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她并不属于人间
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.26,1:53:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴求无望 老二陷入了疯癫
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.14,1:53:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了能和她真正在一起 他自杀身亡
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.72,1:53:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 死神取走了老二的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.85,1:53:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而说到老三 死神找了他好多年
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.64,1:53:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,却始终没能找到他
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.19,1:53:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟中最小的老三 一直活到了很大年纪
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.07,1:53:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,才脱下隐形斗篷 交给了他儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.74,1:53:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他像老朋友见面一样迎接了死神
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.56,1:53:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,并以平等的身份与死神一起 安然离开了人间
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.05,1:53:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 这些就是死亡圣器
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.15,1:53:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 我还是不太理解
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.76,1:54:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.43,1:54:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最具威力的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.15,1:54:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,复活石
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.81,1:54:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.27,1:54:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,合在一起 就组成了死亡圣器
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.61,1:54:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,合在一起 便能主宰生死
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.15,1:54:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在戈德里克山谷的坟墓上也有那个标记
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.01,1:55:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛夫古德先生
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.19,1:55:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩弗利尔家族和
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.18,1:55:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡圣器有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.27,1:55:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊格诺图斯 借过 还有他的兄弟卡德摩斯和安提俄克
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.36,1:55:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被认为是圣器最初的拥有者
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.54,1:55:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此也是这个故事的灵感来源
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.78,1:55:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的茶都凉了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.35,1:55:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.60,1:55:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们快撤吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.39,1:55:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想喝那玩意了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.34,1:55:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他是热的还是凉的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.03,1:55:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢您 先生 - 您忘记烧水了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.01,1:55:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么水 - 泡茶的水
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.59,1:55:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太傻了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.30,1:55:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您的好意 但我们也该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.61,1:55:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们不能走
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.80,1:56:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.03,1:56:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.51,1:56:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我写的东西让他们很恼火
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.67,1:56:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们抓走了她
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.27,1:56:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓走了我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.20,1:56:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.87,1:56:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要真是你 就有救了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.11,1:56:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把她抓走了 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.09,1:57:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.78,1:57:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.98,1:57:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,背信弃义的混球
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.63,1:57:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道就没人可信了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.91,1:57:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢娜是因为他支持我才被食死徒抓走的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.30,1:57:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是被逼无奈
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.22,1:57:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去施防护魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.07,1:57:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 美女
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.75,1:58:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻站着啊 抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.08,1:59:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 告诉我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.15,1:59:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.69,1:59:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林德瓦 格林德瓦
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.31,1:59:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道总有一天你会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.99,1:59:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你一定知道
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.34,1:59:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的东西已不在我手里了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.14,1:59:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 格林德瓦 告诉我它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.05,1:59:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我谁拿了它
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.21,1:59:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖当然和他在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.49,1:59:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,深埋地底
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.57,1:59:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,与邓布利多一起
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.47,2:00:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣器真的存在
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.17,2:00:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他只在找最后一个
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.95,2:00:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.02,2:00:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮之前他就会得到它
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.32,2:00:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道老魔杖在谁那吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.99,2:00:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要碰她 - 放开他
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.28,2:00:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你男朋友再不老实点的话
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.26,2:00:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可会吃更多苦头哦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.09,2:00:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸怎么了 丑八怪
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.27,2:00:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说你
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.57,2:00:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么 - 达力 弗农·达力
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.95,2:00:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,查下名单
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.69,2:00:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 我的小甜心
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.07,2:00:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫你什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.64,2:00:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,珀涅罗珀·克里尔沃特 混血
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.03,2:00:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面没有弗农·达力
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.81,2:00:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没 丑八怪 你在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.45,2:00:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不想让我们知道你是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.65,2:01:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄错了 我已经说过我的名字了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.54,2:01:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.83,2:01:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把这些大鱼交给魔法部
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.69,2:02:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把德拉科叫来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.88,2:02:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.64,2:02:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能确定
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.92,2:02:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,近点看 儿子
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.99,2:02:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能把波特交给黑魔王
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.28,2:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的一切都会一笔勾消
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.99,2:02:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还会像以前一样受宠 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.66,2:02:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不要忘了是谁抓到他的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.41,2:02:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福先生
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.37,2:02:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你竟敢在我家这样跟我说话 - 卢修斯
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.28,2:02:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害羞 宝贝 走近点看
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.41,2:02:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科 要是我们把黑魔王叫来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.10,2:02:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他又不是波特 那我们就都完蛋
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.89,2:02:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,得确保万无一失
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.77,2:03:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的脸怎么回事 - 是啊 他的脸怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.48,2:03:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到他时 他就这样
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.10,2:03:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是在树林里中了什么咒吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.01,2:03:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不凑巧啊 是你干的吗 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.64,2:03:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的魔杖给我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.87,2:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我瞧瞧你最后施的什么咒语
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.52,2:03:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.19,2:03:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.68,2:03:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪找到的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.09,2:03:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她包里搜出来的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.66,2:03:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是我的了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.57,2:03:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.41,2:03:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去 滚
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.46,2:03:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,西茜 把这两个男孩关进地窖
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.12,2:04:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和她好好谈谈
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.18,2:04:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘间的谈话
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.69,2:04:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.31,2:04:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让赫敏和她单独在一起
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.90,2:04:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.42,2:04:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.54,2:04:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢娜
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.71,2:04:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那剑本该躺在我的金库里
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.75,2:04:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么得到的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.62,2:04:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友从我的金库里偷来的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.66,2:04:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没拿
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.10,2:04:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不信
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.11,2:04:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得做点什么 - 这里根本没有出路
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.57,2:04:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试过各种方法 这里被施了魔法
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.53,2:05:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在流血 哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.62,2:05:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种保持清醒的方法真稀奇啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.90,2:05:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.69,2:05:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开她 - 你滚开 退后
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.95,2:05:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妖精 你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.04,2:05:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比 你怎么到这来了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.27,2:05:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比当然是来救你 哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.08,2:05:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比会永远保护哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.55,2:05:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你可以移形出入这个地牢吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.11,2:06:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能带我们一起吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.42,2:06:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 先生 我是个精灵
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.96,2:06:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.23,2:06:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 多比 我想让你带着卢娜和奥利凡德先生去…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.21,2:06:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝壳小宅 在汀沃斯的近郊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.67,2:06:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.46,2:06:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,整装待发了 先生
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.42,2:06:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我先生吗 我真喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.72,2:06:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒后在楼梯口见面
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.69,2:06:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要他的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.71,2:06:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后再问你一遍 小妖精
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.93,2:06:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要好好想清楚了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.54,2:06:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是怎么进去的 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.29,2:07:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 你吃白饭的啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.82,2:07:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁闯入了我的金库
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.22,2:07:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁偷了它
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.53,2:07:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 偷了它
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.14,2:07:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能闯入古灵阁 宝剑还在那里
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.69,2:07:16.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（泥巴种）
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.23,2:07:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它怎么在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.50,2:07:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比古灵阁更安全的地方了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.86,2:07:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.67,2:07:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你走运 小妖精
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.95,2:07:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一个可没这么幸运了 - 去死吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.54,2:07:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.47,2:07:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.31,2:07:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.35,2:07:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下魔杖
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.91,2:07:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没 放下魔杖
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.76,2:07:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科 快去捡起来 好 很好
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.30,2:08:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.46,2:08:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.70,2:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又焕然一新 神气十足了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.90,2:08:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候叫黑魔王来了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.03,2:08:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤他
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.94,2:08:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.63,2:08:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.73,2:09:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢精灵 你差点杀了我
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.55,2:09:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比从不想杀任何人
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.60,2:09:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比只想把你弄残或是重伤
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.44,2:09:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎敢夺走巫师的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.46,2:09:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎敢反抗你的主人
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.59,2:09:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比没有主人
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.83,2:09:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比是一个自由的精灵
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.59,2:09:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比是来救哈利·波特和他的朋友的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.14,2:09:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 你们都还好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.26,2:10:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全了 安全了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.87,2:10:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.86,2:10:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.18,2:10:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比 你会好起来的 坚持住
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.39,2:10:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.90,2:10:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再坚持一下 我们会治好你的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.51,2:10:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏 你包里…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.23,2:10:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有东西可以救他 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.90,2:10:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.81,2:10:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.45,2:10:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方真美
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.39,2:10:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能和朋友们在一起
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.61,2:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,多比很开心
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.89,2:11:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能和朋友在一起
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.74,2:11:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.47,2:11:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的眼睛阖上吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.54,2:11:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.58,2:11:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在他可以安眠了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.23,2:11:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想安葬他
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.10,2:12:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让他去得体面 我要亲手安葬
